waymap (8.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for Kali Linux
  * Advanced Web Application Security Scanner with AI-powered vulnerability analysis
  * Includes SQLi, XSS, CMDi, SSTI, LFI, CORS, CRLF, open redirect, API scanning
  * WordPress security scanning with WPScan integration
  * Google dork discovery via SerpApi
  * AI-powered vulnerability analysis with multiple LLM providers
  * Multi-threaded scanning with configurable workers
  * Comprehensive reporting (HTML, CSV, Markdown, PDF)

